# Made by a tailor, especially if made to order; [[bespoke]].
# Perfectly [[appropriate]] to some specific occasion or purpose; made to one's specific [[requirement]]s.
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2023 December 27|author=Richard Foster|title=New rail freight terminal leads the way|journal=RAIL|issue=999|page=41|text=Any local businesses looking to use rail freight now have a '''tailor-made''' facility ready and waiting.}}

